{
  "thought_summary": "首先需要确定目标文件的位置，以便进一步调查 find_first_in_sorted 函数的实现。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "list_files",
    "arguments": {
      "path": ".",
      "max_depth": 1,
      "max_entries": 100
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "已找到目标文件 find_first_in_sorted.py，下一步是检查该文件中 find_first_in_sorted 函数的实现。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "inspect_code",
    "arguments": {
      "file_path": "find_first_in_sorted.py",
      "start_line": 1,
      "context_lines": 20,
      "max_lines": 50
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "已获取 find_first_in_sorted 函数的实现，下一步是检查其在目标不存在或位于边界时的行为。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "search_code",
    "arguments": {
      "query": "return -1",
      "path": "find_first_in_sorted.py",
      "regex": false,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "max_results": 1
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "搜索代码时出现错误，可能是路径参数不正确。需要重新检查路径并尝试再次搜索。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "search_code",
    "arguments": {
      "query": "return -1",
      "path": ".",
      "regex": false,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "max_results": 1
    }
  }
}

